 />Daniel Stein,<br />Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Frank Han,<br />Michael Tang\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2015–16</td>\n<td>Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Kenrick Bjelland,<br />Frank Han,<br />Daniel Qu,<br />Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Daniel Qu</td>\n<td>Daniel Qu\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2014–15</td>\n<td>Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Jordan Haack</td>\n<td>Daniel Qu,<br />Daniel Stein,<br />Henry Wang,<br />Nathan Weckwerth</td>\n<td>Jordan Haack\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2013–14</td>\n<td>Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Michael Tang</td>\n<td>Henry Wang</td>\n<td>Michael Tang\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2012–13</td>\n<td>Roy Zhao</td>\n<td>Ian McMeeking,<br />Andy Ylitalo,<br />Roy Zhao</td>\n<td>Abram Sanderson</td>\n<td>Ian McMeeking,<br />Roy Zhao\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\"National_competition_performances_.28USAMO.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_competition_performances_(USAMO)\">National competition performances (USAMO)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minnesota_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National competition performances (USAMO)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_of_America_Mathematical_Olympiad\">United States of America Mathematical Olympiad (USAMO)</a> </b>\n</p><p>- <b>Qualifiers from Minnesota</b> (alphabetical order) (since 2012)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"1\">Year</th>\n<th>USAMO</th>\n<th>USAJMO\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025\n</td>\n<td>Eric Ding, Samuel Kretzschmar, Sneha Kundu, Jinu Lee, Jefferson Zhou\n</td>\n<td>Zack Berchenko, Michael Luo, Taison Scofield, Austin Wang\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://maa.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-USAJMO-Awardees.docx.pdf\">Eric Ding, Angie Huang</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2023\n</td>\n<td>Kenneth Chen, Matthew Chen, Katherine Zhu\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2022\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sGMffeeaSN5JGBxYbep7TdBKJwJGRJJm/view?usp=sharing\">Kenneth Chen, Matthew Chen, Linden Lee, Minkai Li, Kevin Yang, Andrew Zhang</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WLaoSHSg35aGG6G9voifjGCDzzBfaoqD/view?usp=sharing\">Henry Zheng</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2021\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2021/MO%20List.pdf\">Garv Khurana, Linden Lee</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2021/JMO%20List.pdf\">Matthew Chen, Andrew Zhang</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2020/MO%20List.pdf\">Linden Lee, Alexander Zhu</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2020/JMO%20List.pdf\">Matthew Chen, Kevin Yang</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2019\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2019/2019%20USAMO%20IDs.pdf\">Frank Han, Frank Lu, Alexander Zhu</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org/sites/default/files/pdf/AMC/usamo/2019/2019%20USAJMO%20IDs.pdf\">Linden Lee, Jason Wang, Kevin Yang, Alexis Yi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2018\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pBcBbE9XYK2EvahcKNN8yRIChGRpOIyL/view?usp=sharing\">Frank Han, Frank Lu, Daniel Stein</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MHZFF2HS